Subject: [PATCH] agent: advance ready commands after native events

Association notifications already represent completed native changes, but
admission and retirement waited for the 250 ms orchestration tick. Progress
ready work after agent events on the existing manager thread and recursive
command lock. Preserve pending order, exclusive radio ownership and the
normal periodic timeout path; event dispatch never advances timeout stats
or transient retry/cancellation handlers. The controller keeps its existing
dispatch path. No protocol, security, scan or reporting interval is shortened.

Upstream-Status: Pending

